{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（29日）下午1時44分，石崗黎屋村一間村屋的天台發生火警，據報傳出爆炸聲，驚動多人報案。消防員接報到場灌救，於16分鐘後將火救熄，初步相信是有雜物起火，事件中無人受傷、毋須疏散。消防員在現場尋獲一隻貓，惟牠現場被證實死亡，屍體隨即用白布掩蓋。</p><figure><img alt=\"人員在場調查。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181619493605347328813257.jpeg/tp5ySsMyU4YNp9hVL3PNi2IoG6gpA233Ig3QjyIN0I8\"/><figcaption>人員在場調查。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是村屋天台。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181619490002309120635749.jpeg/wgkoB3DZyISCZX30bGDOo-zPfho5tsVAU9cIblPXCG4\"/><figcaption>現場是村屋天台。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電力公司人員在場了解事件。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181619487418486784957012.jpeg/kC-mgz0rI6hsgLyIxzfrgcFYn5jwidTCaRrTt2ka07c\"/><figcaption>電力公司人員在場了解事件。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員及電力公司人員在場調查火警起因。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181619484624949248851236.jpeg/ieLKfAXxGywqT5QgjCFRlHpLQADGBEyaiWV0dIlldHQ\"/><figcaption>消防員及電力公司人員在場調查火警起因。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"天台疑有雜物起火。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181621141635076096495136.jpeg/bkZUyoIcdSeZx-M8nnbFUXnRao7lC8YCrAVyRooFckY\"/><figcaption>天台疑有雜物起火。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員用白布蓋住貓屍。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181621144835461120325710.jpeg/_nW262VxQDhTi2cY1F2iymw43dces0WMSdjoym_Y6Mo\"/><figcaption>消防員用白布蓋住貓屍。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員用白布蓋住貓屍。（黃煦緻攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260929/1181621147570278400957648.jpeg/pdn3aR423HCn3TtVyu60-xb5MIZ9v71nqpsQ8oybEPI\"/><figcaption>消防員用白布蓋住貓屍。（黃煦緻攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T07:20:31.541474+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}